Package: castvote
Title: Read, Standardize, and Tabulate Ranked-Choice Voting Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Matthew", "Pancia", email = "msp@themsp.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
    Read cast vote records from multiple vendors, normalize them to a common
    long-format schema, parse official round-by-round reports, and tabulate
    instant-runoff elections under configurable rules.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4)
Imports:
    checkmate,
    cli,
    digest,
    data.table,
    logger,
    readr,
    RcppSimdJson,
    readxl,
    withr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
